# MDIO reads answer the error bit until page 769 register 16 bit 10 is set,
# which is the reduced-frequency mode I219 datasheet 9.2 requires. The page
# register and 769.16 itself stay reachable so the bootstrap can happen; that
# exemption is ours and not the datasheet's, and codex-vm says so at the flag.
#
# Off by default, so every existing green keeps the floor it was measured on.
-e1000-mdio-slow
